      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "雲從隊　十五小隊（但步兵六十人チ以一小隊トシ二小隊チ以一中隊トシ五中隊チ以一大隊トス）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "雲従隊　十五小隊（但し歩兵六十人を以て一小隊とし二小隊を以て一中隊とし五中隊を以て一大隊とす）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Yonezawa main-line troops (Unjū-tai): 15 companies (小隊), reckoning 60 infantry to a company, 2 companies to a 中隊, and 5 中隊 to a battalion (大隊) — i.e. ≈900 men. Fascicle 8 prints military after officials, so this overflows to the right of the ○淀藩 marker and belongs to Yonezawa."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "米澤雲從隊"
